1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,205
B.Sc. mein topper tha, phir bhi naukri nahi.

2
00:00:03,505 --> 00:00:08,097
Vikas beta, topper hai to bachchon ko padha! Ghar pe tuition shuru kar!

3
00:00:08,397 --> 00:00:10,366
Dadi, bachche aayenge kahan se?

4
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:14,394
Ek board, bench, aur mohalle mein parche. 10 hazaar mein shuru.

5
00:00:14,694 --> 00:00:19,134
Pehle ek demo class free de. Result achha aaya, to bachche khud aayenge.

6
00:00:19,684 --> 00:00:23,343
Sir, mera beta Maths mein fail ho raha hai. Kuch kijiye!

7
00:00:23,643 --> 00:00:28,315
Roz ek ghanta, mahine ke 1,500. Teen mahine mein result dikhega.

8
00:00:28,615 --> 00:00:32,245
Chaar batch, 40 bachche, yaani mahine ke 60 hazaar.

9
00:00:32,545 --> 00:00:36,460
Phir YouTube pe bhi padha. Online bachche poore desh se aayenge.

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,582
Vikas Sir ki class, housefull! Life set!
